// torogao-fall-protocol/1 — design tables for the Where She Asks
// to Fall systems core, transcribed from the clean-room design
// record (~/workspace/nsfw-remakes-20261108/games/
// where-she-asks-to-fall-design.md, D-1140).
//
// Every value below is a DESIGN value set by that doc — nothing
// is measured from the studied original, which was excluded as
// a content source at its S2c screen (premise-only remake under
// the Roseford pattern). The day table's shape is structural:
// block N is anchored by lesson N, a block's first day is the
// Deep session (Full edition), days 2-10 are Practice days
// (Lite). Meter increments live in the layer rows (data, not
// code): each layer's full-attendance total clears its exit
// threshold, and each sessions-only total falls short — the
// drills are load-bearing, per design section 5.

